          "why": "Angles around a point make one complete turn of 360°.",
          "sol": "Step 1: 75° + 125° = 200°\nStep 2: x = 360° - 200°\nStep 3: x = 160°.",
          "hint": "A complete turn is 360°.",
          "subject": "math",
