          "why": "The formula adds the length and width and doubles their sum to include all four sides.",
          "sol": "Step 1: Write P = 2(l + w).\nStep 2: Substitute: P = 2(12 + 5).\nStep 3: P = 2 × 17 = 34 cm.",
          "hint": "Use P = 2(l + w).",
