          "why": "A square has four equal sides.",
          "sol": "Step 1: P = 4s.\nStep 2: P = 4 × 11.\nStep 3: P = 44 cm.",
          "hint": "Multiply one side by 4.",
          "subject": "math",
          "chapter": "geometry",
