          "why": "The triangle occupies half the area of a rectangle with the same base and perpendicular height.",
          "sol": "Step 1: A = ½ × b × h.\nStep 2: A = ½ × 14 × 8.\nStep 3: A = ½ × 112 = 56 cm².",
          "hint": "Multiply 14 by 8, then divide by 2.",
          "subject": "math",
