          "why": "Substitution produces values satisfying both equations.",
          "sol": "Step 1: x + (x + 2) = 8\nStep 2: 2x + 2 = 8\nStep 3: 2x = 6\nStep 4: x = 3\nStep 5: y = 3 + 2 = 5",
          "hint": "Replace y in the second equation with x + 2.",
