          "why": "Differentiation reverses integration",
          "sol": "Step 1: Differentiate both sides\nStep 2: d/dx (x³/3 + C)\nStep 3: Apply power rule → (3x²)/3\nStep 4: Simplify result\nStep 5: Get f(x)",
